                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} E^\bullet(f) \colon E^\bullet(Y) \to E^{\bullet}(X)
            is a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/dual+morphism"} dual morphism
            together with self-
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/dual+objects"} duality
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivalences"} equivalences
            for
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msup
                    %mi E
